  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "EngineEventManager serves as the central service layer responsible for capturing all low-level browser input events, including mouse movements, keyboard presses, and gamepad states. It acts as a bridge, translating raw DOM events into state changes within the engine's static input managers. Its primary duty is to initialize listeners and update input states once per frame, ensuring game logic has consistent access to user input data."
  },
